{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/114b4e6d76018c7e7e36de47f8158a7d71794d04f1a575e31408803c59ba962ac3b15579c1534fce4b47bcccb7fb81f590aff7676a92c371b704a7732e05fed7","height":1400,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/2AT_TIxyMX0Inqd9Rk4ejaFoRmOOczEwM9E5xz4DfYxaUqgdkXsCRKOX3uHYFOjyU9VwwFzGGCsZnf6BYmkPP0x3OjztRk02SB3O_HOBLz_vXdvoi2g","width":1400},"name":"Liam Spradlin","title":"Senior UX Designer, Material Design"},"document_id":5402053906792448,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>颜色是设计中最清晰的表达方式之一，尤其是当品牌或产品的形象需要渗透到人们接触它的每一个角落时。应用的界面为色彩运用提供了沃土：颜色不仅能塑造形象，而且——由于用户会直接触摸和操作界面——还能以贴近用户生活与经验的方式传达这一形象，并强化产品的功能、实用性与个性。</p>\n<p>Material Design 提供了一套全面的颜色系统，让设计师和开发者可以在全局层面做出决策，并让这些颜色决策层层贯穿整个产品，自动处理状态、强调和对比等问题。</p>\n<h2>Material 中的颜色</h2>\n<p>为了实现这一切，Material 使用一组明确定义的颜色槽位，它们共同构成“颜色主题（color theme）”。颜色主题中设有主色（primary）和次色（secondary）的槽位，它们会影响关键组件；此外还设有自定义背景颜色、表面颜色（surface color，用于有海拔高度的表面或“面板/sheet”）以及错误颜色的槽位。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\">&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">还有若干用于“On”颜色（On colors）的槽位，得名于这些颜色会出现在其他元素“之上”（on top）。例如，On Primary（主色之上） 用于出现在应用主色之上的文字、图标或其他元素。想象一个带有菜单图标和标题的应用栏：两者都使用“On”颜色，以确保保持恰当的对比度和可读性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">对于状态等更细致的颜色运用，Material 使用“色调调色板（tonal palette）”。色调调色板会基于你所选的颜色提供 10 个色值，给出更浅和更深的选项，让你的颜色主题更加灵活。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">选择品牌颜色</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">从零开始</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">如果你要从零开始构建颜色主题——也就是说，你并没有现成的品牌调色板——一个很好的切入点是思考你的应用的特质。在我们的 <a href=\"https://material.io/design/material-studies/about-our-material-studies.html\">Material Studies</a>（围绕真实世界用例和产品约束设计的示例应用）中，你可以看到基于每个应用的功能和个性、运用颜色进行品牌塑造的多种方法。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">你的应用是像深色调个人理财应用 Rally 那样、帮助人们高效处理信息的实用工具吗？还是像 Shrine 那样、以精致美学和粉色调激发用户灵感的现代而考究的购物应用？又或者，它是像 Owl 那样的教育应用，力求让教育和学习成为有趣的体验，并配上一个同样有趣的调色板。在以上每一种情况中，颜色都在塑造和强化应用个性方面扮演着重要角色。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">&lt;mio-image index=3&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">对于像 <a href=\"https://material.io/design/material-studies/rally.html\">Rally</a> 这样以查看和管理个人财务数据为核心的应用来说，采取克制的用色方式十分重要。这个应用的主色是绿色。Rally 的 On 颜色是白色，背景颜色则是深灰色调。其他颜色被严格保留，专门用于在各类仪表盘屏幕上清晰呈现数据。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e778fcca-7fff-8fb0-34cc-87c2131ed43b\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">&lt;mio-image index=4&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"https://material.io/design/material-studies/owl.html\">Owl</a> 则处于光谱的另一端：它在颜色主题中使用了三种不同的主色，营造出有趣而活泼的氛围。尽管 Owl 在同一个应用中看起来仿佛拥有三种不同的颜色主题，但它们都由模仿色轮三原色的鲜艳明亮的颜色——黄色、红色和蓝色——串联在一起。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">&lt;mio-image index=5&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"https://material.io/design/material-studies/shrine.html\">Shrine</a> 则介于两者之间。这个应用对颜色有着鲜明的态度：主色和次色采用乳脂般的粉色调，On 颜色则是深棕色。Shrine 的调色板虽然个性鲜明，但它在应用中的运用专注而精致，体现出 Shrine 想要塑造的个性——一个现代而优雅的时尚与生活方式购物之地。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">从零开始制作自己的主题时，不妨想想你的应用在这些示例所构成的光谱上会处于什么位置。首先选择一个你认为最能表达应用个性与用途的主色。然后，根据你希望应用给人的感觉，选择一个能强化或调和这些特质的次色。再想想如何使用 On 颜色，或者如何将新颜色应用到表面或背景上，以强化整体表达。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">如果你已有品牌调色板</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">在为应用构建颜色主题时，你可能已经拥有一个可以轻松转化为 Material 颜色主题的品牌调色板。如果是这样，你可能已有品牌指南，其中规定了应优先使用哪些颜色，以及如何诠释品牌的个性或基调。你可以按照上文所述，把这些信息结合起来，决定在颜色主题中纳入哪些颜色。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">如果你有品牌调色板却没有指南，可以翻看现有的品牌物料或界面，并与调色板进行对比，判断哪些颜色应被优先考虑，或视作主色和次色。<a href=\"https://material.io/tools/color\">测试</a>这些颜色，确认它们能否满足无障碍的对比度要求。如果不能，你可以从色调调色板中选择一个满足要求的变体。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">用调色板生成器扩展你的调色板</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">为此，请查看下方嵌入的 <a href=\"https://material.io/design/color/the-color-system.html#tools-for-picking-colors\">调色板生成器</a>。只需在右侧添加你选定的颜色，然后点击每个生成的色板即可复制其十六进制色值。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><iframe style=\"height: 720px; width: 100%; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\" src=\"https://material.io/inline-tools/color/\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></p>\n<h2><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">将主题可视化</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">选好颜色并将其扩展为 <a href=\"https://material.io/design/color/the-color-system.html#tools-for-picking-colors\">色调调色板</a> 之后，就可以把颜色填入 Material Design 提供的槽位，真正创建颜色主题了。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">要在设计环境中做到这一点（并即时预览主题在 Material 组件上的效果），请复制一份我们的 <a href=\"https://www.figma.com/@materialdesign\">Baseline Design Kit for Figma</a>。在套件中的 Material Theme 页面上，你会看到一个名为 Color 的画框，它全面展示了你的颜色主题，包括色调调色板。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">&lt;mio-image index=6&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">在屏幕右侧，你会看到一个面板，其中 Color Styles 下方包含与主题颜色相对应的全局样式。要开始把颜色填入主题，请点击每个颜色样式旁边的编辑图标。然后回到生成器中的色调调色板，点击工具中的每个色板复制其十六进制色值，再填入 Figma 中相应的样式。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=7&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>处理好主色和次色色板后，再到 Figma 的 Stickersheet 页面看看你的主题在每个组件上的效果。</p>\n<h2>接下来做什么？</h2>\n<p>在此基础上，你还可以尝试调整表面、背景和错误颜色，进一步打磨新的颜色主题。你还可以像上文 Owl 的例子那样创建多个主题，在颜色系统上发挥更多创意。</p>\n<p>当你构思出完美的颜色主题后，可能就准备好动手实现了。相关指南请参阅 Nick 撰写的关于 <a href=\"https://material.io/blog/android-material-theme-color\">实现 Material 颜色主题</a> 的文章。</p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-8eac49a8-7fff-2e3e-b297-a9568f2700d0\"></span></span></p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"Diagram of Material color theme displaying the baseline Material color theme","bordered":true,"caption":"The baseline Material color theme","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/bf1ba7da670b9eaa49d0a89fc62f664521d553f0a81adc7e52ce8521a15700aef5d39b7ebbfd4d3c449efde073d2dd643c53459fb2c8bcb00aa772df0a99c316","height":962,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/qPIgbhKubYWR16dQrxTyAy4ZAJ-d3D9rBA-AjbhD5XvwbQwJE3mUG9hDru1tkPLhi-YqxYtbiGJwNkkYgDcCBgnzIDKN4dmFi3J2qzk","width":1064}},{"a11y_description":"Screen with purple top navigation containing an expandable menu icon, Page title, favorite icon, search icon, and more icons","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/404a2715d102fd5bc091480c97a3ea51ef77b5a1abede4edb82d07f4a37fc1622783c85202c83696ec9c00413bb6b0b3fb38a2563d81b4f64db24a05beb814f4","height":358,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/EF44xt9wKpOK_zlRaDzD4DlHdvwKK0cIAdZFplsnqxaKZm4o1uN2twcAUHIB_JYArrJyhn0fOZ0iG9Cc_N-xuki3z5WtyGm5ENIB","width":1064}},{"a11y_description":"Screen with color scheme using primary purple 500, secondary purple 700, and tonal purple 200","bordered":true,"caption":"This UI uses a primary color and two primary variants, mapped across all components","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/07a87bc5caed671737184f9db5630dda11bfa0ebf678da8ab44abf1adee613eba32f1c88cd267202988a4634c447677292be07d46c90ea3ef5bd5cdf61b02c99","height":1064,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1VQgOPxvnllToKQuGkrj24pk0dyoMeteT4_nW2l2kv0rlVGl7GV6GxxPHQNCF-7WOgWWjyGzJ4Lx5Ro5z3jIOvCD_4_gcVoQCzT38g","width":1064}},{"a11y_description":"Color scheme for the Rally app, mapping to different UI components","bordered":true,"caption":"Rally uses two colors from its color theme for each infographic on screen","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/e1365e316dd694fbde25604d30366cf01f799b82bc6a11a2823dd5442e50234be925b434d395e9c497fd309da64fb1d9659616a37dcec2b13312b5e926e1ce87","height":1064,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/f5AhiCZp50k7HocQqV4OH9DxOiBOKg2eNvT2KP4GICHpvk3OlaTBp8Eg7W3HytmYLOCmV45W2ps8hqrxHD7ax4BC1HnWJzUCo9W4-g","width":1064}},{"a11y_description":"3 screens for the Owl app showing three themes with primary colors for theme 1, yellow 500, theme 2, blue 700, theme 3, pink 500","bordered":true,"caption":"Owl uses three color themes to distinguish different parts of the app","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/959235ba15dde2364768e84f99cfddf631be12ce76b191447df824032a3934f6f06a1087ab97b137609b04c6ca90cd37ae69564cd2f9976a0344bd8810be103d","height":1064,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/cAHzNGtcaJoRQu9eXuGPZb0s-DiuRC